    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Esawu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh jeacheenga Esawu (nea Edomu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esawu ghaghi gadeamgaaschi bea eemeeda Ganaani: nea Adahi was hudeaba Eloni bea eemeeda Hiti, sea Oholibama was hudeaba Ana was orjeeda Sibeyoni bea eemeeda Hifi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Basemati, was hudeaba Shumwaheeli, was huda geenyea Nebayoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwajiilsa Ada Esawu, Elifasi; ak gwaji Basemati ea Reueli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwaji Oholibama Yeushi, ea Yalamu, ea Gora. Suh orjooga Esawu sijiilsa ng'eanyiida Ganaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat Esawu gadeamgaaschi, ea orjoagaaschi, ea haweagaaschi, ea buuneesean bea gheanyi, ea dugwaaschi, ea diyeangaaschi suurja, ea haleanjeadaanyi sean mideawa nyas aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani; ak gawa ng'eanyiida sheageewa orjeeda ghaamwat was Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba dugwa nyaawa aasaang'a muuchi mayghoamu gwandeayi duwaawi; aba gideaba ng'eanyiida mida madeayi aba giibinda jea gwandeayeesa sea dugwa nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobiida Esawu ng'eanyiida heayeeniga Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh jeacheenga Esawu was ghweanda fuga Edomu mida giijeega Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh gheawunga orjooga Esawu: Elifasi gil was orjeeda Adahi was gatmooda Esawu, ea Reueli was orjeeda Basemati was gatmooda Esawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Elifasi: Demani gil, ea Omari, ea Sefo, ea Gatamu, ea Genasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Dimna abeeda niny gwealeeda Elifasi, was orjeeda Esawu; gwajiilsa Elifasi Amaleki.) Suh orjooga Adahi, was gatmooda Esawu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Reueli; Nahati gil, ea Sera, ea Shama, ea Miisa. Suh orjooga Basemati, was gatmooda Esawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Oholibama was hudeaba Ana orjeeda Sibeyoni, was gatmooda Esawu; gwajiilsa Esawu Yeushi, ea Yalamu, ea Gora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh dooshinga orjooga Esawu. Duweacheeda Esawu was Elifasi gheambaghweanda jiilu dooshing'su: Deema, ea Omari, ea Sefo, ea Genasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gora ea Gatamu, ea Amaleki; suh dooshinga Elifasi aba ng'eanyiida Edomu; suh orjooga Adahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Reueli, was orjeeda Esawu: dooshinga Nahati, ea Sera, ea Shama, ea Miisa; suh dooshinga Reueli aba ng'eanyiida Edomu; suh orjooga Basemati gil, was gatmooda Esawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Oholibama, was gatmooda Esawu: dooshinga Yeushi, ea Yalamu, ea Gora; suh dooshinga jih Oholibama was hudeaba Anahi, was gatmooda Esawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Esawu (was Edomu), nea suh ea dooshinga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Seiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Seiri bea eemeeda Hori, was fuga mida ng'eanyiida: was Lotani, ea Shobali, ea Sibeyoni ea Ana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dishoni, ea Eseri sea Dishani. Suh dooshinga Hori, was orjooga Seiri mida ng'eanyiida Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Lotan Hori gil sea Hemani; nea huda geenyea Lotan geeguura Dimna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Shobali: Alfani, ea Manahati, ea Ebali, ea Shefo sea Onamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Sibeyoni: Aiya gil ea Ana; amadu ghwanyas Ana gheang'deenda mida beega gareadi aba dareapcheeda, damanda ahaaghwiida digeeniga ghwaan was Sibeyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh diibiga Anahi: Dishoni gil ea Oholibama was hudeaba Ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Dishoni: Hemdani gil, ea Eshbani, ea Itrani sea Gerani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Eseri: Bilhani gil, ea Saawani sea Akani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Dishani: Usi gil sea Arani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Hori; was dooshinga Lotan gil, ea Shobali, ea Sibeyoni ea Ana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dishoni, ea Eseri, sea Dishani; suh dooshinga Hori aba gidabeada dooshinga nyaawa aba ng'eanyiida Seiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoodiga Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh sugoodiga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida Edomu, nea abeeda ea miighoahaaghwa eemeeda Israeli sugoochean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela orjeeda Beyori ghoahaaghwa ng'eanyiida Edomu, nea mujiineadaanyi geeguura Dinhaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghami Bela, ak ghoaghiis hoorgeadaanyi Yobabu was orjeeda Sera mida mujiineeda Bosra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghami Yobabu, ak ghoaghiis hoorgeadaanyi Hushamu bea ng'eanyiida Demani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghami Hushamu, ghoaghiis hoorgeadaanyi orjeeda Bedadi siguura Hadadi, ghayi joar fuga Midiyani aba ng'eanyiida Moabu, nea gheawunga mujiineadaanyi geeguura Afiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghami Hadadi ak ghoaghiis hoorgeadaanyi Samla bea ng'eanyiida Masreka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghami Samla, ak ghoaghiis hoorgeadaanyi Shauli bea mujiineeda Rehoboti mida ghuuteenda Furati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghami Shauli, ak ghoaghiis hoorgeadaanyi Baal-hanani was orjeeda Akbori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghami Baal-hanani was orjeeda Akbori, ak ghoaghiis hoorgeadaanyi Hadadi, nea gheawunga mujiineadaanyi geeguura Bau; nea gatmoadaanyi geeguura Mehetabeli, was hudeaba Matredi, hudeaba Mesahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
